  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 2c64450fa688f4f4997f0af2404393cb, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 29
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 2
    m_MaxSize: 50
    m_Alignment: 1
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Email Verification Instructions:

    Please ensure that the email address
    you provide is authentic, valid, and capable of receiving messages normally.
    Once you have collected the specified number of fragments, the system will automatically
    send a unique redemption verification link to this email address. You must click
    the link to complete the final redemption process.



    Personal Responsibility
    Clause:

    The official team assumes no responsibility for any failure to receive
    the verification link caused by player-related reasons (including, but not limited
    to, incorrect email entry, full mailbox storage, blocking settings, or the email
    being misclassified as spam). In such cases, if the redemption fails or rewards
    are lost, they will not be reissued.



    Anti-Cheating Regulations:

    Any
    form of cheating (including the use of third-party assistive software, scripts,
    or exploiting system vulnerabilities to farm fragments) is strictly prohibited.
    Upon verification of such behavior, the official team reserves the right to immediately
    disqualify the player from redemption, revoke any illicitly obtained items, and
    suspend or ban the offending account.'
